    "detailed_description": "\u00b7 Hardcore first-person fantasy dungeon adventure game<br />\r\nEscape from the unpredictable dungeons, or head deeper to discover miracles and treasures...<br />\r\nThe dead who came back from the dead only wanted to drag you down,<br />\r\nDo adventurers from other players have the same purpose as the dead?<br />\r\nPray, or good fortune and miracles will not favor you,<br />\r\nUpon death, all your belongings are buried in the dungeon...<br />\r\nKeep going with your team, the legendary treasure is right in front of you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7 Exclusive to your character<br />\r\nMatch your stats, talents, skills, armor, and weapons,<br />\r\nYou want to be a berserker with strength, or an assassin with speed? Or the highest spellcaster in the realm of magic...<br />\r\nIf you're a little more exotic, a fierce mage can also be refreshing.<br />\r\nYou are the protagonist of the game, and only you can determine your own play style.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7 A freely traded market<br />\r\nDon't want to sell off your in-game items and equipment to a merchant?<br />\r\nWant to buy more sophisticated equipment only to find that the equipment and items sold by merchants are never as good as the equipment dropped by monsters and treasure chests?<br />\r\nNo problem, our black market and exchange will make buying and selling a better experience for you.",
    "about_the_game": "\u00b7 Hardcore first-person fantasy dungeon adventure game<br />\r\nEscape from the unpredictable dungeons, or head deeper to discover miracles and treasures...<br />\r\nThe dead who came back from the dead only wanted to drag you down,<br />\r\nDo adventurers from other players have the same purpose as the dead?<br />\r\nPray, or good fortune and miracles will not favor you,<br />\r\nUpon death, all your belongings are buried in the dungeon...<br />\r\nKeep going with your team, the legendary treasure is right in front of you.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7 Exclusive to your character<br />\r\nMatch your stats, talents, skills, armor, and weapons,<br />\r\nYou want to be a berserker with strength, or an assassin with speed? Or the highest spellcaster in the realm of magic...<br />\r\nIf you're a little more exotic, a fierce mage can also be refreshing.<br />\r\nYou are the protagonist of the game, and only you can determine your own play style.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u00b7 A freely traded market<br />\r\nDon't want to sell off your in-game items and equipment to a merchant?<br />\r\nWant to buy more sophisticated equipment only to find that the equipment and items sold by merchants are never as good as the equipment dropped by monsters and treasure chests?<br />\r\nNo problem, our black market and exchange will make buying and selling a better experience for you.",
    "short_description": "Forgotten Lands is a first-person PVPVE dungeon adventure game. Go to the dungeon to fight various monsters to obtain treasure. As the darkness engulfs, a more terrifying existence is about to descend, and perhaps you can find here a treasure that countless people dream of only existing in legend.",
